{
    "data": [
        {
            "id": "eli/dl/event/MTG-PL-2024-02-07-VOT-ITM-939983",
            "type": "Activity",
            "activity_date": "2024-02-07",
            "activity_id": "MTG-PL-2024-02-07-VOT-ITM-939983",
            "activity_label": {
                "sk": "Rastliny z\u00edskan\u00e9 ur\u010dit\u00fdmi nov\u00fdmi gen\u00f3mov\u00fdmi technikami a potraviny a krmiv\u00e1 z\u00a0nich vyroben\u00e9 ***I",
                "lv": "Augi, kas ieg\u016bti ar noteiktiem jauniem genomikas pa\u0146\u0113mieniem, k\u0101 ar\u012b par p\u0101rtiku un bar\u012bbu, kas satur \u0161\u0101dus augus, sast\u0101v vai ir ra\u017eota no tiem ***I",
                "da": "Planter frembragt ved hj\u00e6lp af visse nye genomteknikker samt f\u00f8devarer og foder, der er fremstillet heraf ***I",
                "lt": "Tam tikrais naujais genomikos metodais i\u0161vesti augalai ir i\u0161 j\u0173 gaminamas maistas bei pa\u0161arai ***I",
                "en": "Plants obtained by certain new genomic techniques and their food and feed ***I",
                "sl": "Rastline, pridobljene z nekaterimi novimi genomskimi tehnikami, ter hrana in krma iz njih ***I",
                "fr": "V\u00e9g\u00e9taux obtenus au moyen de certaines nouvelles techniques g\u00e9nomiques et les denr\u00e9es alimentaires et aliments pour animaux qui en sont d\u00e9riv\u00e9s ***I",
                "mul": "V\u00e9g\u00e9taux obtenus au moyen de certaines nouvelles techniques g\u00e9nomiques et les denr\u00e9es alimentaires et aliments pour animaux qui en sont d\u00e9riv\u00e9s",
                "bg": "\u0420\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f, \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u0447\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u043d\u044f\u043a\u043e\u0438 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438 \u0433\u0435\u043d\u043e\u043c\u043d\u0438 \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0438, \u0438 \u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0438 \u0444\u0443\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043e\u0442 \u0442\u044f\u0445 ***I",
                "hu": "Az egyes \u00faj g\u00e9nkezel\u00e9si technik\u00e1k \u00fatj\u00e1n nyert n\u00f6v\u00e9nyek \u00e9s a bel\u0151l\u00fck sz\u00e1rmaz\u00f3 \u00e9lelmiszerek \u00e9s takarm\u00e1nyok ***I",
                "mt": "Pjanti miksuba minn \u010berti tekniki \u0121enomi\u010bi \u0121odda u l-ikel u l-g\u0127alf tag\u0127hom ***I",
                "pt": "Vegetais obtidos por determinadas novas t\u00e9cnicas gen\u00f3micas e os g\u00e9neros aliment\u00edcios e alimentos para animais deles derivados ***I",
                "el": "\u03a6\u03c5\u03c4\u03ac \u03c0\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b3\u03bf\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03b9 \u03bc\u03b5 \u03bf\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03bc\u03ad\u03bd\u03b5\u03c2 \u03bd\u03ad\u03b5\u03c2 \u03b3\u03bf\u03bd\u03b9\u03b4\u03b9\u03c9\u03bc\u03b1\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ad\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b5\u03c7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ad\u03c2, \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c4\u03c1\u03cc\u03c6\u03b9\u03bc\u03b1 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b6\u03c9\u03bf\u03c4\u03c1\u03bf\u03c6\u03ad\u03c2 \u03c0\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c0\u03c1\u03bf\u03ad\u03c1\u03c7\u03bf\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b1\u03c0\u03cc \u03b1\u03c5\u03c4\u03ac ***I",
                "de": "Mit bestimmten neuen genomischen Techniken gewonnene Pflanzen und die aus ihnen gewonnenen Lebens- und Futtermittel ***I",
                "es": "Vegetales obtenidos con determinadas nuevas t\u00e9cnicas gen\u00f3micas y alimentos y piensos derivados ***I",
                "it": "Piante ottenute mediante alcune nuove tecniche genomiche, nonch\u00e9 alimenti e mangimi da esse derivati ***I",
                "nl": "Met bepaalde nieuwe genomische technieken verkregen planten en de daarvan afgeleide levensmiddelen en diervoeders ***I",
                "ro": "Plantele ob\u021binute prin anumite noi tehnici genomice \u0219i alimentele \u0219i furajele derivate din ele ***I",
                "fi": "Tietyill\u00e4 uusilla genomitekniikoilla tuotetut kasvit ja niist\u00e4 per\u00e4isin olevat elintarvikkeet ja rehut ***I",
                "sv": "V\u00e4xter som framst\u00e4llts med vissa nya genomiska metoder och d\u00e4rav framst\u00e4llda livsmedel och foder ***I",
                "ga": "Planda\u00ed a fhaightear tr\u00ed theicn\u00edc\u00ed g\u00e9an\u00f3ma\u00edocha nua \u00e1irithe agus a mbia agus a mbeatha ***I",
                "hr": "Biljke dobivene odre\u0111enim novim genomskim tehnikama te hrana i hrana za \u017eivotinje od njih ***I",
                "pl": "Ro\u015bliny uzyskiwane za pomoc\u0105 niekt\u00f3rych nowych technik genomowych oraz pochodz\u0105ce z tych ro\u015blin \u017cywno\u015b\u0107 i pasze ***I",
                "cs": "Rostliny z\u00edskan\u00e9 n\u011bkter\u00fdmi nov\u00fdmi genomick\u00fdmi technikami a potraviny a krmiva z t\u011bchto rostlin ***I",
                "et": "Teatavate uute genoomikameetodite abil saadud taimed ning nendest toodetud toit ja s\u00f6\u00f6t ***I"
            },
